---
description: Lightning Web Component and Aura review — XSS, wire/Apex, a11y
globs:
  - "**/lwc/**"
  - "**/aura/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

# LWC review

- No untrusted `innerHTML` or `lwc:dom="manual"` without sanitization.
- Do not store secrets in JS or browser storage.
- UI permission checks do not replace Apex CRUD/FLS.
- `cacheable=true` / `@wire` paths must be read-only.
- Handle Apex and `@wire` errors. Do not fail silently.
- Do not mutate `@api` objects; copy and emit events.
- Prefer LWC over new Aura. Keep business rules that enforce security in Apex.
- GraphQL and LMS must not replace Apex CRUD/FLS or carry secrets/PII in client messages.
